                    79.0,
                    878.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Compare these two versions. In 1a we have to read and understand seventeen words (gold) before we get to its long main subject (underlined) and verb (bold-faced). In 1b, we get past the short main subject and verb in just seven words:",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
